WEBVTT

1
00:00:04,050 --> 00:00:09,510
In order to avoid people's eyes and ears, we cut through the road

2
00:00:09,510 --> 00:00:15,000
If there is any movement, everyone should lie down

3
00:00:15,000 --> 00:00:22,190
It was the same group of people who robbed us last time.

4
00:00:22,190 --> 00:00:25,660
Leave things behind and people can leave

5
00:00:25,660 --> 00:00:27,660
We can give you part of it

6
00:00:27,660 --> 00:00:28,660
Everyone lives

7
00:00:28,660 --> 00:00:30,660
There is no need to fight to the death

8
00:00:30,660 --> 00:00:33,980
I'm talking about everything, take off your clothes too

9
00:00:33,980 --> 00:00:38,410
you are crazy

10
00:00:38,410 --> 00:00:39,410
dozens of degrees below zero

11
00:00:39,410 --> 00:00:41,410
What is the difference between asking us to take off our clothes and killing someone?

12
00:00:41,410 --> 00:00:42,410
It’s not enough to give you some supplies.

13
00:00:42,410 --> 00:00:45,410
If you don’t give it, then you can stay here by yourself.

14
00:00:45,410 --> 00:00:48,600
This world is already extremely dominated by the weak and the strong.

15
00:00:48,600 --> 00:00:49,600
If you can't fight them off

16
00:00:49,600 --> 00:00:51,600
It's us who die here

17
00:00:51,600 --> 00:01:00,300
Pick it up for me, boss
